sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant Fleet as Monad Fleet service
    participant API as eLabFTW API

    Device->>Fleet: Hello(device_id, capabilities)
    Fleet->>API: GET /items?search=device_id
    API-->>Fleet: resource or empty

    alt resource missing
        Fleet->>API: POST /items (device_id + mac_address)
    else resource exists
        Fleet->>API: PATCH /items/{id} metadata/body (last_seen_at)
    end

    API-->>Fleet: 200/201
    Fleet-->>Device: ServerConfig(poll_interval_s, server_time)

    loop for each execution event
        Device->>Fleet: PublishEvent(event_id, experiment_id, policy_revision, ...)
        Fleet->>API: first event -> POST /events/{item}
        API-->>Fleet: 201 Created (event id)
        Fleet->>API: PATCH /event/{id} metadata (status, history, summary)
        API-->>Fleet: 200 OK
        Fleet-->>Device: Ack(ok=true)
    end

    Device->>Fleet: final metrics.run_state = COMPLETED/PARTIAL
